    },
    "Changes apply at once and can be undone below. Dictation and Chat instructions still wait for your approval: a meeting or email an AI app reads could contain text meant to change them. Copy the setup below again so your AI app gets the new access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
